window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-093-bdd3bb2d029fe5a5.json"]={sha256:"bdd3bb2d029fe5a55a6a3ace2c89d901eaaa767b5c2828f8eda01bc8387f604c",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-692bacd4df1dcbad","url":"https://www.cyber.gc.ca/en/guidance/ransomware-playbook-itsm00099","title":"Ransomware playbook ITSM.00.099","titleEn":"Ransomware playbook ITSM.00.099","publisher":"Canadian Centre for Cyber Security","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-093","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-093","related":[{"id":"security-v26-094","referenceUrls":["https://restic.readthedocs.io/en/stable/045_working_with_repos.html"],"title":"Restic：資料讀回、雜湊與可用復原","titleEn":"Restic: reading backup data and proving usable restores","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付相依圖、95分鐘時程、乾淨復原驗收項與未達目標時的服務降級方案。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the dependency graph, ninety-five-minute schedule, clean-recovery acceptance checks and degraded-service fallback.","difference":"用自編文字檔建立測試備份，保存snapshot識別與原檔摘要，再復原到全新目錄核對。","differenceEn":"Create a test backup of original text files, retain snapshot ID and source hashes, and restore into a new directory for comparison.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["復原完工時間由相依關係的關鍵路徑決定，不是所有工時任意相加或取最大。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 身分復原30分鐘，之後資料庫40分鐘，再啟動應用25分鐘；備份驗證20分鐘可與身分復原平行。 關鍵路徑30+40+25=95分鐘；平行的20分鐘驗證不額外延長。","全資料讀回時間下界=資料量/有效讀取速率；抽樣只覆蓋被讀到部分，不能宣稱其餘必然完整。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 測試儲存庫有10個各100MB資料包，讀取速率50MB/秒；不計解密與延遲成本。 全讀回1000/50=20秒；只讀2包為200/50=4秒，僅20%資料量。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Recovery completion follows the dependency critical path, not an arbitrary sum or maximum of task times. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Identity recovery takes thirty minutes, then database forty, then application twenty-five; twenty-minute backup validation runs in parallel with identity. The critical path is 30+40+25=95 minutes; parallel twenty-minute validation adds no further delay.","Full-data read lower bound is data size divided by effective read rate; sampling proves only the sampled portion. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A test repository contains ten 100 MB packs read at 50 MB/s, excluding decryption and latency overhead. Full readback takes at least twenty seconds; two packs take four seconds and cover only 20% of bytes.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-003","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/63/4/final"],"title":"NIST 數位身分：IAL、AAL 與 FAL 的分離決策","titleEn":"NIST digital identity: separating IAL, AAL and FAL","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付相依圖、95分鐘時程、乾淨復原驗收項與未達目標時的服務降級方案。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the dependency graph, ninety-five-minute schedule, clean-recovery acceptance checks and degraded-service fallback.","difference":"以匿名閱覽、學徒成績、管理員操作三種服務建立資料與傷害情境；各自記錄 IAL、AAL、FAL 的理由，不把登入成功當真實身分已查證。","differenceEn":"Model data and harm for anonymous reading, learner grades and administration; justify IAL, AAL and FAL independently rather than treating successful login as proven real-world identity.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["復原完工時間由相依關係的關鍵路徑決定，不是所有工時任意相加或取最大。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 身分復原30分鐘，之後資料庫40分鐘，再啟動應用25分鐘；備份驗證20分鐘可與身分復原平行。 關鍵路徑30+40+25=95分鐘；平行的20分鐘驗證不額外延長。","保證向量是三個分開的要求；本地符合率只計算自訂的驗收案例，不可宣稱它就是 NIST 認證分數。 為自訂服務剖面列16個驗收案例；12個符合、4個失敗，所有案例權重相同僅供教學統計。 12/16×100=75%；修正其中兩個後14/16×100=87.5%，高風險失敗仍不可被平均掩蓋。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Recovery completion follows the dependency critical path, not an arbitrary sum or maximum of task times. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Identity recovery takes thirty minutes, then database forty, then application twenty-five; twenty-minute backup validation runs in parallel with identity. The critical path is 30+40+25=95 minutes; parallel twenty-minute validation adds no further delay.","Assurance is a vector of separate requirements; local conformance counts only the chosen acceptance fixtures and is not a NIST certification score. A custom service profile has 16 acceptance fixtures: 12 pass and 4 fail, equally weighted only for teaching statistics. 12/16×100=75%; repairing two yields 14/16×100=87.5%, but averages cannot hide a high-impact failure.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-957b5ec7af682491","url":"https://restic.readthedocs.io/en/stable/045_working_with_repos.html","title":"Restic repository integrity checks","titleEn":"Restic repository integrity checks","publisher":"Restic","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-8005cb990aa13586","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/63/4/final","title":"NIST SP 800-63-4: Digital Identity Guidelines","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-63-4: Digital Identity Guidelines","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
